# The Emissary section 1 at Bastok Markets: Cleades plays his script's mission list 1001; the finish with option 0
# (not 5) does nothing; with option 5 it begins the mission (the Markets' YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION); section 2: Cleades
# plays ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 23. A level 30 Warrior of Bastok, 1-1 to 2-2 completed by a GM. Rival zone-in,
# another mission's script: the login in Bastok Markets plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn,
# which returns 22.
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/713 Metalworks/onEventFinish/714 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
login
trigger Cleades                           # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 5: nothing
trigger Cleades
finish option=5                         # begun
trigger Cleades                           # section 2
